This below description playwright (Javascript) automation test!

This project using POM (Page Object Methode) with this site https://demoqa.com/ and only just for two module that is Web Table and Droppable.

This the flow that project should be run 
1. Bulk Insert User di Web Tables
    URL: https://demoqa.com/webtables 
    Data: File CSV
    Goals : Create user on table using data csv and validate that data should be shown or record on table screen.
2. Drag and Drop (Droppable)
    URL: https://demoqa.com/droppable
    Goals : User can drag and drop object to target area.
3. Resize Element (Resizable)
    URL: https://demoqa.com/resizable
    Goals : Resize element to 400 × 200 pixel.
4. Student Registration Form
    URL: https://demoqa.com/automation-practice-form
    Goals : Create data form Student Registration and then verify on popup confirmation.

Tools :
1. Node.js
2. Vscode (Text Editor)
3. Playwright (framework)
4. Javascript (language)

You can use these syntax for more detail!
- How configure web browser you can change setting on playwright.config.js line 37
- How declare priority test file/folder you can setting on playwright.config.js line 15
- How to run/execute -> npx playwright test tests/webtables.spec.js
